  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id": "enx21", "module": "public", "subject": "英语", "chapter": "ch-en-1", "knowledgePoint": "词汇与搭配", "type": "single", "typeLabel": "单选", "difficulty": 1, "difficultyLabel": "基础", "stem": "I ____ my homework already.", "options": ["finish", "finishes", "have finished", "finished"], "answer": "have finished", "tags": ["时态"], "source": "batch", "pitfalls": ["have finished"], "explainLevel": "subject-specific", "hint": "【结论】have finished 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：I ______ my homework already.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 hav", "analysis": "【审题】题干：I ______ my homework already. already 是现在完成时标志。 【语法点/词汇】现在完成时 have/has + 过去分词。already/just/yet/ever/never 是标志。finish → finished。 【步骤】① already → 现在完成。② I → have finished。③ A. finish——现在，错。④ B. finishes——三单，错。⑤ C. have finished ✓。⑥ D. finished——过去，不强调对现在的影响，欠佳。 【答案】C. have finished。 【易错】already 用一般过去；finished 写成 finish（过去分词同形）。 【口诀/模板句】already just yet 用完成，have/has + 过去分；I have finished 表已完成，对现在有影响明。", "steps": ["【秒懂考点】already现在完成，have finished", "【语法点/词汇】现在完成时 have/has + 过去分词。already/just/yet/ever/never 是标志。finish → finished。", "【步骤】① already → 现在完成。② I → have finished。③ A. finish——现在，错。④ B. finishes——三单，错。⑤ C. have finished ✓。⑥ D. finished——过去，不强调对现在的影响，欠佳。", "【口诀/模板句】already just yet 用完成，have/has + 过去分；I have finished 表已完成，对现在有影响明。", "【答案】have finished"]});
  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id": "enx22", "module": "public", "subject": "英语", "chapter": "ch-en-1", "knowledgePoint": "词汇与搭配", "type": "single", "typeLabel": "单选", "difficulty": 1, "difficultyLabel": "基础", "stem": "We should keep our classroom ____.", "options": ["clean", "cleaning", "cleaned", "to clean"], "answer": "clean", "tags": ["词性"], "source": "batch", "pitfalls": ["clean"], "explainLevel": "subject-specific", "hint": "【结论】clean 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：We should keep our classroom ______.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ 正确答案是 clea", "analysis": "【审题】题干：We should keep our classroom ______. keep + 宾语 + 形容词（宾补），保持某种状态。 【语法点/词汇】keep sth. + adj.（keep the room clean）；keep sb. doing（让一直做）。 【步骤】① keep our classroom + 状态。② clean 形容词作宾补。③ A. clean ✓。④ B. cleaning——keep classroom cleaning 语法别扭，应 clean，错。⑤ C. cleaned——被动分词不表状态，错。⑥ D. to clean——不定式表目的，不作宾补状态，错。 【答案】A. clean。 【易错】keep + doing 与 keep + adj. 混。 【口诀/模板句】keep sth. 加形容，保持状态最常用；keep him waiting 是 doing，宾补形式看词性。", "steps": ["【秒懂考点】keep sth+形容词，keep clean保持干净", "【语法点/词汇】keep sth. + adj.（keep the room clean）；keep sb. doing（让一直做）。", "【步骤】① keep our classroom + 状态。② clean 形容词作宾补。③ A. clean ✓。④ B. cleaning——keep classroom cleaning 语法别扭，应 clean，错。⑤ C. cleaned——被动分词不表状态，错。⑥ D. to clean——不定式表目的，不作宾补状态，错。", "【口诀/模板句】keep sth. 加形容，保持状态最常用；keep him waiting 是 doing，宾补形式看词性。", "【答案】clean"]});
