  window.STUDY_DATA.questions.push({"id": "enx39", "module": "public", "subject": "英语", "chapter": "ch-en-1", "knowledgePoint": "词汇与搭配", "type": "single", "typeLabel": "单选", "difficulty": 1, "difficultyLabel": "基础", "stem": "Don't forget ____ your homework tomorrow.", "options": ["bring", "to bring", "bringing", "brought"], "answer": "to bring", "tags": ["非谓语"], "source": "batch", "pitfalls": ["to bring"], "explainLevel": "subject-specific", "hint": "【结论】to bring 【考点】词汇与搭配 【一步步怎么算】 ① 句子/题干：Don't forget ______ your homework tomorrow.。 ② 定位考点：词汇与搭配。 ③ 用规则排除错误时态/语态/搭配。 ④ ", "analysis": "【审题】题干：Don't forget ______ your homework tomorrow. forget to do（忘记去做，还没做）；forget doing（忘记做过）。 【语法点/词汇】tomorrow 表明作业还没做，用 forget to bring（别忘了带）。 【步骤】① tomorrow → 动作未发生。② forget to bring。③ A. bring——缺 to，错。④ B. to bring ✓。⑤ C. bringing——forget bringing 是“忘了曾经带过”，与 tomorrow 矛盾，错。⑥ D. brought——错。 【答案】B. to bring。 【易错】forget to do / forget doing 混。 【口诀/模板句】forget to do 忘去做，forget doing 忘做过；tomorrow 将来没做，to bring 才不会错。", "steps": ["【秒懂考点】Don't forget to do，记得去做，to bring", "【语法点/词汇】tomorrow 表明作业还没做，用 forget to bring（别忘了带）。", "【步骤】① tomorrow → 动作未发生。② forget to bring。③ A. bring——缺 to，错。④ B. to bring ✓。⑤ C. bringing——forget bringing 是“忘了曾经带过”，与 tomorrow 矛盾，错。⑥ D. brought——错。", "【口诀/模板句】forget to do 忘去做，forget doing 忘做过；tomorrow 将来没做，to bring 才不会错。", "【答案】to bring"]});
